    "sections": {
        "description": "STHosting is a modern and professional WordPress theme created for hosting companies, domain providers, and technology service businesses. Its sleek layout features a gradient color palette of blue, black, and green, creating a bold yet trustworthy visual identity that appeals to tech-savvy audiences. With a clean design and intuitive structure, STHosting enables you to showcase hosting plans, domain search tools, and IT services in a professional and engaging manner, helping visitors quickly recognize your brand’s credibility and reliability. Optimized for performance and SEO, STHosting is fully responsive and lightweight, providing a smooth browsing experience across all devices. The theme integrates seamlessly with popular plugins such as Elementor and MetForm, allowing you to create attractive pages and custom forms without any coding knowledge. Whether you are launching a new hosting business or upgrading an existing website, STHosting offers a strong foundation that is fast, flexible, and designed to help convert visitors into customers."
    },
